{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我出門了。」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "出門前，我跟櫻乃打聲招呼。", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今天也去愛理家？」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 361, "voice": "sk0623", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔……嗯。」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是那樣沒錯……但是被櫻乃淡淡的語氣一說，「今天也」這三個字讓我莫名害羞。", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……櫻乃也來嗎？」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我不想當電燈泡。」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 361, "voice": "sk0624", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我又不是去跟她親親熱熱的……」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然能享受兩人獨處的時光的確讓我很開心啦。", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過目前要把該做的事情要確實做好。", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "愛理今天也會拼命念書吧。我也一起加油……", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，新吾……咳、咳。」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar3038", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什麼、怎、怎麼回事！？妳還好吧！？」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我連忙趕到她身邊。", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "愛理看起來很不舒服的樣子。", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「感冒……？」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好像是……有點，咳咳！一個不注意昨天在暖桌睡著了，大概……」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar3039", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……為什麼？」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一直在為考試念書，不知不覺就……」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar3040", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……我可以想像得到那個景象。", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她白天也是努力念書到過頭的程度……", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咳、咳！」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar3041", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「總之……今天休息比較好。」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我拍了拍愛理的背，溫柔地催促她。", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──愛理的身體，隔著衣服也能感覺到好熱。", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不可能那麼做吧……明天、唔唔、考試就要開始了！」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar3042", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "愛理不接受我的建議。", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔唔……沒錯，我才解題解到一半，新吾也、咳咳、來坐下吧……」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar3043", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看來在我來之前，她也一直在念書。", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "整個人都搖搖晃晃了……", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈啾！唔……」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar3044", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理，來，愛理。」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔……」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar3045", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳已經強迫自己１個小時了吧……？妳必須停下來休息一下才行。」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「很煩欸！不要打擾我念書！」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar3046", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈啾！」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar3047", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──那之後，不管我怎麼說愛理還是不肯休息。", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "埋頭拼命念書。", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊唔……唔唔……唔唔……」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar3048", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊真是的……好好工作啊，我的腦袋……」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar3049", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "身體狀況似乎越來越惡化。", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的臉色發白，整個人都搖搖晃晃的。", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理……」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不要……」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar3050", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「為什麼要這樣？」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我要考到年級第一名才行啊！」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar3051", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我忍不住大聲問她，愛理卻用更大的音量回答我。", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我咬緊牙關注視著愛理。", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾也聽過我跟媽媽說的話吧……」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar3052", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "愛理彷彿很艱難才說出這句話。", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我跟媽媽約好要保持成績，才讓我、咳咳……讓我一個人生活的。」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar3053", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明明是這樣、唔唔，只是感冒而已……不能因此影響到考試念書……！」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar3054", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──這似乎是愛理的驕傲，也是她的自尊。", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我非常明白。她的心情都傳達給我了。", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔、唔唔……咳咳、唔……唔～」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar3055", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是，愛理在我面前痛苦地呻吟。明明痛苦卻仍動著筆。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔……」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果在以前……", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我絕對不會做干擾她這份意志的行為吧，不過──", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……夠了，給我去休息！！！」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我大吼。", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──現在不同了。", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不是看她臉色的時候了，我很擔心愛理，我必須這麼做才行……", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "應該說，只有我才能這麼做。", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸、啊、欸、欸……新、吾……？」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar3057", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……妳該休息了。」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar3058", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什……什麼嘛，討厭，那種事、我、我知道啦……」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar3059", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一下下而已喔，３小時而已。然後我就要起來……只休息３小時而已……」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar3060", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "愛理雖然不情願，但還是躺到了床上。", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我輕輕點頭。", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "愛理的身體狀況太糟糕，她一躺下立刻就睡著了。", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘶……嘶……嗯嗯……」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar3061", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "３個小時過後她也沒有醒。", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar3062", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我一直待在她身邊，幫她換額頭上的濕毛巾以及擦汗。", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "當然，我不打算叫醒她，我希望她繼續休息。", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔……唔、唔……」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar3063", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「連睡著也這麼不舒服，還那樣逞強……」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "胸口好難受。呼吸不過來的感覺。", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "以前，經常在愛理身上感覺到的「緊繃感」，我……又感覺到了。", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "尖銳犀利，又逞強……彷彿下一秒就要斷裂的緊繃感。", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈……哈啊、哈啊、唔咕……新、吾……」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar3064", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我輕柔地摸摸愛理的頭髮。", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這個叫做瀨名愛理的女孩子，總是散發出緊繃的氣息。", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「媽……媽……唔唔……唔啊、啊……」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar3065", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──跟學園長之間，一直存在的緊繃感。", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一想到這點我實在坐立難安。", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "拿出手機──", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『你好，我是安潔～』", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "ag0569", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔，不好意思突然打給妳……安潔知道學園長的電話嗎？」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『喔、喔……知道啊……』", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "ag0570", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可以告訴我嗎？我想找她。……愛理生病了。」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我來到室外打電話。", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──我覺得要把現狀告訴那個人比較好。", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔說學園長現在在學校裡。", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以我重新撥打結女的電話……", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『……喂，電話換人接了。』", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 366, "voice": "rk0229", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，學園長您好，我是瓜生。不好意思突然打電話給您。」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『怎麼了？』", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 366, "voice": "rk0230", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "電話那頭的學園長直接問重點。", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我哽了一下，然後慎重地說。", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那個……其實我有件事想告訴您。」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『小新吾有事對我說？是什麼呢？』", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 366, "voice": "rk0231", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……愛理同學生病了。」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『…………』", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 366, "voice": "rk0232", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「應該是感冒，雖然不需要太擔心……」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過她逞強念書，所以變成這樣。」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──我會聯絡學園長當然是因為她是愛理的監護人。", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過除此之外，我也想知道她聽了會有什麼反應。", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理同學，一副賭氣的感覺。非常在意學園長的想法的樣子。」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──我無法放著這件事不管。", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "為什麼這兩個人會……", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「學園長，那個……」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『……是愛理叫你聯絡我的嗎？』", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 366, "voice": "rk0233", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "打斷我的話，學園長冷靜地問。", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……不是，是我擅自決定的。」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我只能這樣回答。", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『喔……』", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 366, "voice": "rk0234", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『那麼，我不會再聽你說。』", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 366, "voice": "rk0235", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學園長平穩的語氣中混著一絲嘆息。", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她結束這個話題。", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『不過，小新吾在照顧著愛理是吧？』", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 366, "voice": "rk0236", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『……謝謝。愛理就麻煩你了。』", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 366, "voice": "rk0237", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……說完後，她就掛斷了電話。", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「葛格。」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 361, "voice": "sk0625", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我回到室內。在我暫時出去的這段時間，是櫻乃代替我照顧愛理。", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是在打給安潔之前，我請她來幫忙的。", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「學園長說什麼……？」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 361, "voice": "sk0626", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理麻煩你了，就這樣。」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……這樣啊。」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 361, "voice": "sk0627", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理呢？」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒有變化。」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 361, "voice": "sk0628", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這樣啊……我打算今天住下來，櫻乃呢？」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一起。」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 361, "voice": "sk0629", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……謝謝妳。」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也在愛理身旁坐下。", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然內心還是躁動不安……", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──總之，現在就專心照顧愛理吧。", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
